      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "Upload is decoupled from the editor on purpose. A user adding a new asset doesn't need a scene open, and embedding the form in the inspector would conflate \"arrange this scene\" with \"add new bytes to the project.\" The container model means the inspector only ever needs to "
        },
        {
          "insert": "reference",
          "attributes": {
            "italic": true
